\f2 \cf2 \'a0
\f1 \

\f2 By the conclusion of the semester, the curriculum is designed to instill deeply held professional values. Students will value the truth-seeking and the indispensable role of journalism in a democracy. Furthermore, they will value their own agency, evolving into informed, responsible global citizens prepared to navigate the digital job environment and information landscapes with confidence and adaptability.
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 Stage 2: Determine Acceptable Evidence
