\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f2 \cf2 The landscape of artificial intelligence is characterized by rapid, perpetual evolution. Traditional assessments focused solely on evaluating a final product are flawed and highly vulnerable to academic dishonesty via LLMs. Therefore, the assessment strategy for JOUR 3318 demands a reimagining of acceptable evidence. The focus shifts to evaluating the 
\f3\i process
\f2\i0  of inquiry (prompting, triangulation of facts, and transparent documentation of digital investigations).
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

