\f0\b\fs28 \cf2 Summative Capstone Investigation
\f1\b0\fs32 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs28 \cf2 Students design and execute an original, AI-integrated investigative project tied to an emerging news event or a student-selected issue of inquiry. Evidence can involve constructing Python monitoring scripts, securely archiving transient evidence using Hunchly, processing massive unstructured data sets using Google Pinpoint, and synthesizing the triangulated findings into a compelling digital narrative. 
\f1\fs32 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs28 \cf2 Represents the ultimate synthesis of all course competencies, requiring the student to create digital media that serves unmet public information needs while maintaining absolute editorial control over the AI tools utilized. 
