\f0\b Evaluation Criteria and AI-Resilient Rubrics
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f2 \cf2 To reliably evaluate student performance on these complex, process-oriented tasks, specific, AI-resilient rubrics are needed. The central criterion for evaluation across all assessments will be the concept of triangulation. The method requires students locate multiple, independent vectors of evidence (e.g., a verified witness account, cross-referenced satellite imagery, and public database records) to corroborate a single narrative assertion.
\f1 \

\f2 The rubrics will explicitly measure student performance based on the following criteria:
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf2 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Methodological Transparency and Preservation:
\f2\b0  Has the student provided a verifiable chain of custody for their digital evidence? Did they proactively utilize secure automated archiving platforms, such as the Bellingcat Auto Archiver or Ubikron, to preserve URLs and source code before the material suffered link rot or intentional deletion by hostile actors? 
\f1 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Prompting Logic and Analytical Oversight:
\f2\b0  When utilizing powerful AI tools like Google Pinpoint for massive document analysis or Rolli AI for algorithmic source verification, did the student critically evaluate the machine's output? The rubric will require the submission of interactive prompt histories alongside critical justifications outlining exactly why the student relied on a specific tool, proving they actively checked for LLM hallucinations and data bias.
\f1 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Taxonomic Accuracy:
\f2\b0  In the deconstruction of deceptive media, did the student correctly apply the academic taxonomy of Information Disorder? Did the analysis accurately distinguish between the nuances of false context, imposter content, and manipulated content, demonstrating a sophisticated understanding of intent? 
\f1 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Depth of OSINT Methodologies:
\f2\b0  Did the investigation successfully move beyond superficial search engine queries? The rubric will reward advanced website fingerprinting techniques, such as matching AdSense monetization IDs across disparate domains or utilizing favihash algorithms to expose hidden networks attempting to obscure their IP addresses behind content delivery networks.
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 Self-Assessment and Metacognitive Reflection
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f2 \cf2 The course seeks to facilitate a shift from passive media consumption to active, critical engagement. Students will keep a journal documenting their personal interactions with algorithmic platforms.
\f1 \

\f2 Periodically throughout the semester, students will be invited to step back from platforms like TikTok and Instagram, analyze their own scrolling patterns, habits, and addiction loops, and reflect on how the course has recalibrated their cognitive approach to incoming information. This self-assessment serves as evidence that the student has successfully internalized journalistic skepticism. It shows they have gained agency over their digital environment, achieving the enduring understanding that they are not powerless against the flood of digital media and coordinated algorithmic manipulation.
\f1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

