\f0\b\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf2 Phase 2: The Discipline of Verification and OSINT Fundamentals
\f1\b0\fs32 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf2 Transitioning to applied skills, lab sessions will utilize the Bellingcat Online Investigations Toolkit and the CUNY Fact-checking Guide. Students engage in guided workshops to execute advanced reverse image searches, extract EXIF data, and investigate online reviews via platforms like Trustpilot. 
\f1\fs32 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf2 Directly equips students with the visual verification tools necessary to succeed in the Job Vetting and Video Forensic Analysis authentic performance tasks. Cultivates the value of journalistic skepticism. 
