\f0\b\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf2 Phase 4: Deep AI Integration and Original Creation
\f1\b0\fs32 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf2 The final instructional phase immerses students in advanced AI applications. Students interact with Google AI Studio apps to understand machine learning mechanics. Lab activities transition to utilizing Google Pinpoint and the GDELT Project to index and analyze massive, decades-long archives of public records. Instructors lead workshops on the capabilities and limitations of AI detection mechanisms like Google DeepMind's SynthID. 
\f1\fs32 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\sa213\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf2 Addresses the complex intersection of AI and journalistic integrity. Provides the advanced technical training required for students to execute near real-time verification and design their original, AI-integrated investigative projects. 
